# Frozen cursor: PIA1 UG8 reads its CB1 input (VIDEO_ON, the retrace) as 0, so the retrace interrupt never comes: the keyboard is scanned and the cursor blinked only in that interrupt. The banner still prints (the editor polls the VIA for the retrace).
machine bw2001
title "Frozen cursor"
brief "The BW-2001 prints its banner, but the cursor never blinks and nothing typed on the keyboard appears."
fault stuck UG8.CB1 0
